+# that is not a one-line platform branch lives in CZ_ANDROID_DIR (that project's
+# dead-rising-2/native), shared by both Dead Rising 2 ports: the build fragment
+# (android.cmake), the SDL_main/JNI entry points and logcat bridge, the Vulkan driver
