+    // leaves the screen, the ANativeWindow behind R->swap.surface is destroyed; the
+    // Java side raises the flag and waits for this release. Let go of everything built
+    // on it, then hold the pump until a new window exists — the guest's next frame
+    // waits on this one, so the game pauses with the app rather than playing unseen.
+    if (Dr2Android_SurfaceLost())
